<title>INDIA: India Ranbaxy, U.S. Specialty Lab tie up.</title>
<headline>India Ranbaxy, U.S. Specialty Lab tie up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian pharmaceuticals major Ranbaxy Laboratories Ltd said it was forming a joint venture with Specialty Laboratories Inc of the U.S.</p>
<p>It said details of the joint venture styled Specialty Ranbaxy Ltd will be announced at a news conference later on Friday. The venture will be officially inaugurated in Bombay on Saturday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
